        <mxCell id="dns-text" value="&lt;b&gt;internal.contoso.com&lt;/b&gt; — private zone&lt;br&gt;linked to both VNets (link-eus, link-cus), autoregistration off&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;app&lt;/b&gt; A record · TTL 30 s&lt;br&gt;→ &lt;b&gt;10.1.1.10&lt;/b&gt; East US while healthy&lt;br&gt;→ &lt;b&gt;10.2.1.10&lt;/b&gt; Central US after failover&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Terraform seeds the record and the watchdog owns it, so it carries &lt;i&gt;ignore_changes = [records]&lt;/i&gt;." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=10;fontColor=#33415C;" parent="1" vertex="1">
